 like a religious message or like  a religious leader in many ways and I  think even people who think I don't like  Lee but I don't like socialism there's  not a lot to argue you know they can  look at you in the saying oh and you  can't really argue with them about that  that all seems good however I put it to  you and I know you're into caring and  respect and I would love to  that but you know that doesn't happen on  TV so so anyway we'll do the next bit  which is why can't it happen on  television like well because people will  say I'm sucking up to you and I'm being  soft and we're giving you an easy time  so you know the way the game works so we  got to sort of change it people say see  people might say you alright look is a  bit hippie like you know that you sort  of want to hug everybody and the critics  will say yeah but there's no content to  what he said he was preaching to the  converted yesterday hardly react to  those who are going to say we want  detail we want detail look there's a  difference between respectful people on  a personal level and conducting politics  in an adult civilised and respectful way  but also I was pointing out some pretty  clear pretty stark facts about the way  the poorest in our society are treated  about the way our economy is very  unbalanced and about the need for  serious levels of investment in  infrastructure and manufacturing  industry so that we grow our economy I  said some pretty blunt things about the  way in which the government has decided  not to intervene to help the people on t  side over the future of their steelworks  I said some pretty blunt things about  the way in which so many people are  living in very poor quality housing with  no housing security whatsoever because  we have a government that is not  interested in regulating the private  rented sector or providing funds for the  development of council housing which  would actually be a good investment for  all of us sorry for interrupting but I  know y